@startuml forms-vol07-flow-uz
title Namunaviy yo'l - OIVga tekshiruv va kuzatuv (7-jild)
autonumber

actor Mijoz as C
participant "Anonim /\npoliklinika xonasi" as OFF
participant "OIV laboratoriyasi\n(7-jild)" as LAB
participant "Dispanser\n(7-jild)" as DISP

C -> OFF : tekshiruv uchun murojaat qiladi
OFF -> OFF : 176-178 tekshiruvni ro'yxatga olish (anonim\nyoki shaxsi aniqlangan), 179 manfiy maqom haqida ma'lumotnoma
OFF -> LAB : namuna
LAB -> LAB : 186 PZR usulida DNK, 187 CD4 immunologiyasi,\n188-193 namunalar jurnallari
alt musbat
  LAB -> DISP : dispanser kuzatuviga yo'llanma
  DISP -> DISP : 175 dispanser nazorat kartasi\n181 ARV / infeksiyaga qarshi dori vositalarini berish
end

note over OFF, DISP
  Maxfiylik asosiy o'rinda: tekshiruv anonim bo'lishi mumkin,
  kirish esa bemor roziligi bilan cheklanadi. Laboratoriyalar
  3-jilddagi kabi tahlil hisoboti andozasiga amal qiladi;
  dispanser kartasi uzoq muddatli yozuvdir.
end note
@enduml
